{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"원본에서 p21의 3개 블록과 p22의 5개 블록을 확인했고, 각 면의 축·인접 치수·合計가 주장과 일치합니다. PDF 회전행렬도 표시 x = 1684 − 원본 y이므로, 좌→우가 fitz y 내림차순이라는 설명과 맞습니다. 이제 전체 골든의 axis 계수와 보고서 포인터를 검증하겠습니다.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\WINDOWS\\\\System32\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\v1.0\\\\powershell.exe\" -Command \"@'\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\nroot=Path('tests/fixtures/plan-import/expected')\naxes=[]\nelevations=[]\nfiles=sorted(root.rglob('*.json'))\ndef walk(v,path,file):\n if isinstance(v,dict):\n  if 'labels' in v and 'spansMm' in v:\n   labels=v['labels']; spans=v['spansMm']; total=v.get('totalMm')\n   axes.append({'ref':file.as_posix()+'#'+path,'labels':labels,'spansMm':spans,'totalMm':total,'holds':len(labels)==len(spans)+1 and (total is None or sum(spans)==total)})\n  if 'elevations' in v:\n   for i,e in enumerate(v['elevations']):\n    elevations.append({'ref':file.as_posix()+'#'+path+'/elevations/'+str(i),'has_axis':isinstance(e.get('axis'),dict)})\n  for k,w in v.items(): walk(w,path+'/'+k.replace('~','~0').replace('/','~1'),file)\n elif isinstance(v,list):\n  for i,w in enumerate(v):walk(w,path+'/'+str(i),file)\nfor f in files: walk(json.loads(f.read_text(encoding='utf-8-sig')),'',f)\nprint(json.dumps({'file_count':len(files),'axes_count':len(axes),'axes':axes,'elevations_count':len(elevations),'missing_axis':[e for e in elevations if not e['has_axis']]},ensure_ascii=True,indent=2))\n'@ | python -X utf8 -\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
